"Nastavitve pravilnika fokusa omejujejo funkcionalnost navigacije po oknih."

#: ui/main.qml:102
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The alternative task switcher is a second switcher with its own separate "
"shortcut, appearance, and behavior settings."
msgstr ""
"Alternativni preklopnik opravil je drugi preklopnik z lastnimi ločenimi "
"nastavitvami bližnjic, videza in obnašanja."

#: ui/OverviewSettings.qml:20
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Overview:"
msgstr "Pregled:"

#: ui/OverviewSettings.qml:23
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label Hint for overview effect enable button"
msgid ""
"Swipe up with four fingers on a touchpad or three on a touchscreen, or use "
"screen edge gestures to toggle the overview"
msgstr ""
"Podrsnite navzgor s štirimi prsti na sledilni ploščici ali tremi na zaslonu "
"na dotik ali uporabite kretnje na robu zaslona za preklop pregleda"

#: ui/OverviewSettings.qml:25
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@label Hint for overview effect enable button, %1 is a keyboard shortcut"
msgid ""
"Press %1, swipe up with four fingers on a touchpad or three on a "
"touchscreen, or use screen edge gestures to toggle the overview"
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite %1, podrsnite navzgor s štirimi prsti na sledilni ploščici ali "
"tremi na zaslonu na dotik ali uporabite kretnje na robu zaslona za preklop "
"pregleda"

#: ui/OverviewSettings.qml:27
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@label Hint for overview effect enable button, %1 and %2 are alternative "
"keyboard shortcuts"
msgid ""
"Press %1 or %2, swipe up with four fingers on a touchpad or three on a "
"touchscreen, or use screen edge gestures to toggle the overview"
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite %1 ali %2, podrsnite navzgor s štirimi prsti na sledilni ploščici "
"ali tremi na zaslonu na dotik ali uporabite kretnje na robu zaslona za "
"preklop pregleda"

